itemRollRanges.ts is generated by scripts/generate-item-roll-ranges.ts from d2data
(https://github.com/blizzhackers/d2data), commit fc469993502d0498809b9fc1af140ee2a9eb8902
(json/uniqueitems.json, json/setitems.json, json/properties.json and json/skills.json).
d2data is under the MIT License below, copied from its LICENSE file at that commit. d2data
converts the game's data tables to JSON; the game data itself belongs to Blizzard.

